{
    "background_story": "In the mystical realm of Aethoria, Teardrop was a gentle dragon born from the heart of a jadeite mountain. Her scales shimmered with an ethereal green light, reflecting the precious stone's vibrant color. As a creature of ancient magic, Teardrop possessed the power to heal the land and its inhabitants. She would often descend from her mountainous lair to roam the valleys, leaving trails of jadeite dust in her wake. This dust was said to have remarkable properties, bringing fertility to the soil and prosperity to the people. The inhabitants of Aethoria revered Teardrop as a benevolent guardian, and her connection to jadeite was a symbol of her deep bond with the natural world. As the ages passed, Teardrop's legend grew, and her name became synonymous with the soothing, balancing energy of jadeite.",
